{"2102300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Mist", "steam_appid": 2102300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know the enemies. You don’t know the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your squads, make the call, and survive real-time encounters where every wave can break your plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, you see the threats ahead - enemy types, rewards, and risks. But that’s all you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t know:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how many enemies will strike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when they will appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how different threats will combine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/5d05a65b0fcdd3c95b880493442f1611.avif?t=1778073821\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the battle begins, your plan is tested in real time. Enemy waves unfold unpredictably:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast units overwhelm your backline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >heavy enemies break your formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ranged threats punish bad positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t execute a perfect strategy - you adapt or collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is not just a stat boost - it defines your tactics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >area attacks to control swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >poison and effects to weaken enemies over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traps and abilities to shape the battlefield</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loadout determines how you respond when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/6fd4a423f393ef40941b9bf8c591fa1a.avif?t=1778073821\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 unique islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 types of player squads with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 upgrade levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 shops with different assortments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ types of unique items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know the enemies. You don’t know the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your squads, make the call, and survive real-time encounters where every wave can break your plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/08e1f590d6e8a99ad6bf0146cdcded2f.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, you see the threats ahead - enemy types, rewards, and risks. But that’s all you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t know:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how many enemies will strike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when they will appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how different threats will combine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/5d05a65b0fcdd3c95b880493442f1611.avif?t=1778073821\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the battle begins, your plan is tested in real time. Enemy waves unfold unpredictably:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast units overwhelm your backline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >heavy enemies break your formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ranged threats punish bad positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t execute a perfect strategy - you adapt or collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/7ef4094ed861e8f0035247f15dcf8783.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is not just a stat boost - it defines your tactics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >area attacks to control swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >poison and effects to weaken enemies over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traps and abilities to shape the battlefield</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loadout determines how you respond when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/6fd4a423f393ef40941b9bf8c591fa1a.avif?t=1778073821\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 unique islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 types of player squads with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 upgrade levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 shops with different assortments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ types of unique items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.poster.avif?t=1778073821\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.webm?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/extras/09a3883946014fe5d639c2abc7fa09ed.mp4?t=1778073821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A real-time tactical game about making the right decisions with incomplete information. Choose your battles, prepare your squads, and adapt on the fly when enemy waves unfold in unexpected ways.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/ee04ee3f8aae7479e8922c2fbf1932d220c2dff2/header.jpg?t=1778073821", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/201e6de60bbcfd4795c124699580fabcf0caf95b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778073821", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102300/201e6de60bbcfd4795c124699580fabcf0caf95b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778073821", "website": "https://rionix.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c